    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "LiteX Instructions for OrangeCrab:",
      "source_hash": 10126038793373572539,
      "context_hash": 14627555886925878674,
      "translation": "OrangeCrab용 LiteX 안내:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434644Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before starting:",
      "source_hash": 3502585286316015308,
      "context_hash": 6483096304724646236,
      "translation": "시작하기 전에:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Make sure you have updated `udev rules` to allow accessing the USB port of the OrangeCrab in user mode, as explained [https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/toolchain.md#orangecrab-ecp5](here).",
      "source_hash": 16660309479753567570,
      "context_hash": 8123387358012894509,
      "translation": "[https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/toolchain.md#orangecrab-ecp5](여기)에서 설명한 대로, 사용자 모드에서 OrangeCrab의 USB 포트에 접근할 수 있도록 `udev rules`를 업데이트했는지 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Synthesize and program:",
      "source_hash": 12633537330918261621,
      "context_hash": 11361891068397197645,
      "translation": "합성 및 프로그래밍:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "(replace `25F` with the one in your device (there is also a `45F` and a `85F` version).",
      "source_hash": 2987270665320110284,
      "context_hash": 14079367010662744289,
      "translation": "(`25F`를 사용 중인 장치에 맞는 것으로 교체하십시오(`45F`와 `85F` 버전도 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Build software: Edit `software/makefile.inc`",
      "source_hash": 17222462949398622363,
      "context_hash": 8359597691824158497,
      "translation": "소프트웨어 빌드: `software/makefile.inc`를 편집하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "set `LITEX_DIR` and `LEARNFPGA_DIR`",
      "source_hash": 14757519120708868658,
      "context_hash": 454645999940297820,
      "translation": "`LITEX_DIR`와 `LEARNFPGA_DIR`를 설정하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "set  `LITEX_PLATFORM` to `gsd_orangecrab`",
      "source_hash": 11869959952880416980,
      "context_hash": 11953085114151917240,
      "translation": "`LITEX_PLATFORM`을 `gsd_orangecrab`으로 설정하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434645Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Copy `LiteOS/boot.bin` and `Programs/hello.elf` to a SDCard Insert the SDCard in the OrangeCrab",
      "source_hash": 8305361214856485073,
      "context_hash": 8200935319273230679,
      "translation": "`LiteOS/boot.bin`과 `Programs/hello.elf`를 SD카드에 복사하십시오. SD카드를 OrangeCrab에 삽입하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "This should load LiteOS from the SDCard",
      "source_hash": 17232792945638922924,
      "context_hash": 16256001639061444618,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 SD카드에서 LiteOS가 로드되어야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:42.434646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
